&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Bay Area (Hybrid – 3 days/week in San Francisco office or Mountain View HQ)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;The opportunity&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you ready to be part of our exciting journey of exponential growth? We are seeking a talented Mid-Market Account Executive to join our expanding Sales team at Otter.ai! In this role, you&#39;ll play a vital role in fueling our revenue engine with innovation and energy, driving the scaling of our business while maximizing value for our customers. You&#39;ll have the chance to collaborate with a dynamic team dedicated to empowering SMBs and Mid-Market customers to harness the power of Otter. This is an excellent opportunity to work alongside exceptional sales talent and our product-focused team.&lt;/p&gt;
