&lt;li&gt;Maintain enterprise-level sales rigor while operating with transactional velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead compelling product demos that showcase Otter AI capabilities and enterprise value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build repeatable outbound and closing motions that help scale our GTM engine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Product, Marketing, and Customer Success to shape our enterprise strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
