&lt;li&gt;Is a true hunter — skilled at outbound prospecting and generating pipeline from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has proven experience running the&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;full sales cycle in a SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has experience selling into SMB/Mid-Market/Enterprise accounts and navigating complex buying processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can manage executive-level conversations while still moving deals forward with urgency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has experience working with security, legal, procurement, and finance stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is proficient with Salesforce, Sales Navigator, Outreach, and modern sales tooling like CommonRoom as well as AI tools like Claude and OpenAI. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in fast-paced, evolving environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is energized by AI and excited to sell category-defining technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Otter.ai&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We are in the business of shaping the future of work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
